From 0cae943ab021d1f808f4252492240dc39ef4bfd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 06:28:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] dt-bindings: power: apple,pmgr-pwrstate: Add t6050
 compatible

The T6050 (M5 Pro/Max) device trees describe the PMGR power state
registers as "apple,t6050-pmgr-pwrstate", "apple,t8103-pmgr-pwrstate",
and the pmgr-pwrstate driver handles them through the T8103 entry, as
for the other SoCs after T6000. Add the per-SoC compatible.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM Claude
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmgr-pwrstate.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmgr-pwrstate.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmgr-pwrstate.yaml
index 1c3bd5a5b5d2..d9cf0b912992 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmgr-pwrstate.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/apple,pmgr-pwrstate.yaml
@@ -65,6 +65,7 @@ properties:
               - apple,t6030-pmgr-pwrstate
               - apple,t6031-pmgr-pwrstate
               - apple,t6041-pmgr-pwrstate
+              - apple,t6050-pmgr-pwrstate
               - apple,t8122-pmgr-pwrstate
               - apple,t8132-pmgr-pwrstate
               - apple,t8140-pmgr-pwrstate
-- 
